          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "warning",
          "guid": "mt2du86fjzjemihp",
          "message": {
            "text": "Fixed a latent bug while routing the language picker through a tracked dismiss: picking a language never closed the picker.\n\nThe old selectLang called a bare close() with no local binding, so it resolved to the global window.close() — a no-op for a normal (non-script-opened) tab. The picker only closed on an outside click. It went unnoticed because the e2e only asserted the toolbar button exists; it never opened the picker.\n\nNow selectLang calls dismissPopup, the single tracked dismiss assigned at the tail from dismissOnOutsideClick (also disposes the autoReposition scroll/resize listeners + the list mount). New e2e in diff-viewing.test.ts opens the picker, asserts it sits above the button, picks 'rust', and asserts it closes.",
            "markdown": "Fixed a latent bug while routing the language picker through a tracked dismiss: picking a language never closed the picker.\n\nThe old `selectLang` called a bare `close()` with no local binding, so it resolved to the global `window.close()` — a no-op for a normal (non-script-opened) tab. The picker only closed on an outside click. It went unnoticed because the e2e only asserted the toolbar button *exists*; it never opened the picker.\n\nNow `selectLang` calls `dismissPopup`, the single tracked dismiss assigned at the tail from `dismissOnOutsideClick` (also disposes the autoReposition scroll/resize listeners + the list mount). New e2e in `diff-viewing.test.ts` opens the picker, asserts it sits above the button, picks 'rust', and asserts it closes."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/client/diff/toolbar.tsx"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 118,
                  "endLine": 136,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  let dismissPopup: () => void = () => {};\n\n  function selectLang(lang: string, auto: boolean) {\n    diffViewStore.actions.update({\n      highlightAuto: auto,\n      highlightLang: auto ? diffViewStore.state.value.detectedLang : lang,\n    });\n    applyHighlighting();\n    updateToolbarLanguage();\n    dismissPopup();\n  }\n\n  function renderPickerList(filter: string): SafeHtml {\n    const q = filter.toLowerCase();\n    const dv = diffViewStore.state.value;\n    if (q === '') {\n      const autoLabel = dv.detectedLang === 'plaintext' ? 'Plain Text' : dv.detectedLang;\n      return (\n        <>"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
